flowchart TD
    A[Harness Execution Evidence] --> B[Recurring Failure]
    B --> C[Root Cause Analysis]
    C --> D{Instruction Defect?}
    D -- No --> E[Improve Skill, Prompt, Code or Gate]
    D -- Yes --> F[Propose Instruction Change]
    F --> G[Human Review]
    G --> H[Approved Update]
    H --> I[Measure Future Results]
